  "acceptance": [
    "A fixture reproduces the current shape: a sealed runner receipt, dirty dist/release members, and unrelated TMP/Plan3.1 evidence. It proves only the inventory members become publication-pending.",
    "Doctor fails closed with `ATM_RUNNER_PUBLICATION_PENDING` for incomplete current-generation inventory, and returns current only after exact publication or recorded recovery disposition.",
    "Publication and release consume the same inventory digest; missing, extra, foreign, stale-seal, or unattributed receipt members fail with a structured remediation.",
    "A governed recovery transaction handles the GIT-0019 generation without raw Git and leaves unrelated Plan3.1/TMP evidence untouched.",
    "The final target worktree is clean except only independently active, explicitly preserved Plan3.1 work; planning worktree is clean.",
    "Focused tests, typecheck, and `validate:cli` pass.",
    "Canonical error-code registry, generated TypeScript registry, and generated error-code documentation describe both G14 publication gates; no caller keeps private recovery prose for either error."
  ],
